---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import photo from '../assets/photo.jpg';
---

<Base
  title="Renato Molina Toth"
  description="CTO, hands-on technical leader, and software engineer. Building products with craft, leading teams with clarity."
>
  <header>
    <h1>Renato<br />Molina Toth</h1>
    <p class="role">Chief Technology Officer & Tech Lead at <a href="https://skillsetter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Skillsetter</a></p>
  </header>

  <div class="body">
    <section class="intro">
      <p>I'm a CTO who still builds every day, just not by typing code anymore. I ship through an AI-driven pipeline built on solid engineering practices and metrics I can actually trust. I set the technical direction, shape the product with the team, and ship right alongside them. At a growing company the CTO wears every hat, and that's exactly how I like it.</p>
      <p>I've been building products since 2011 and leading the teams behind them for most of that time. I've been CTO three times, co-founded a startup, taken hardware from first prototype to mass production, and built a SaaS platform from the ground up. That taught me that <strong>craft</strong> compounds: clean architecture, agile that actually works, and teams that ship with confidence. I'm opinionated about what good software looks like, and I keep the bar high.</p>
      <p>Beyond my own workflow, I'm deep in <strong>AI and LLMs</strong>: putting them into real products, learning where they break, and helping teams adopt them without the hype. I've also built the engineering processes behind <strong>SOC 2</strong> compliance, the kind that make security audits boring. The good kind of boring.</p>
    </section>

    <aside>
      <Image src={photo} alt="Portrait of Renato Molina Toth" width={480} loading="eager" />
      <dl>
        <div>
          <dt>Based in</dt>
          <dd>Vancouver, Canada</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Career</dt>
          <dd><a href="/timeline">Read the journey</a></dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Elsewhere</dt>
          <dd>
            <a href="https://github.com/renatomolina" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/renatomolinat" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
            <a href="https://x.com/renatomolinat" target="_blank" rel="noopener">X</a>
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .role {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.4vw, 1.45rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 62ch) 15rem;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .intro p + p { margin-top: 1.25em; }

  .intro p:first-child {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .intro strong { font-weight: 600; }

  aside {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  aside :global(img) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  dl { margin-top: 1.5rem; }

  dl div {
    padding: 0.65rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  dt { color: var(--muted); }

  dd {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .body { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }

    aside {
      order: -1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 7.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 1.25rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    dl { margin-top: 0; }
    dl div:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }
  }
</style>
